				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1507,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct payload shape for registerView and unregisterView\n\nFix the JSON payload construction for `webview.registerView` and `webview.unregisterView` methods to include the required `viewId` key alongside `handle`.\n\nPreviously, these methods relied on positional args which caused SkyBridge's listener to fail when parsing `Payload.args[1]`, resulting in a silent drop of all `vscode.window.registerWebviewViewProvider` calls. This left the workbench's IWebviewViewService registry empty, causing extension sidebars (Roo, Codex, gitlens, etc.) to render only the `pre/index.html` chrome without host content.\n\nThe fix explicitly maps `First` to `handle` and `Second` to `viewId` in the JSON object, ensuring the payload matches the expected structure and restoring proper extension sidebar functionality.",
			"SHA": "a85cb00ff10a6ba37441d3c4a750a641c4bb0e6f"
		},
